  "prefLabel": "Emp 207.07 Date of Issuance or Filing",
  "priorExpiration": "2008-10-17",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Emp 207.07 Date of Issuance or Filing. All written documents governed by these rules shall be rebuttably presumed to have been issued on the date noted on the document and to have been filed with the department on the actual date of receipt by the department, as evidenced by a date stamp placed on the document by the department in the normal course of business.\n\nSource. #7246, eff 4-30-00; ss by #9126, INTERIM, eff 4-20-08, EXPIRES: 10-17-08; ss by #9296, eff 10-17-08",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/emp100-500.html"
